Relationship to ASD-STE100:
CSE follows the general approach of controlled languages such as ASD-STE100 Simplified
Technical English. CSE does not use or reproduce the ASD-STE100 specification or its
dictionary, does not claim STE100 compliance, and is not affiliated with, endorsed by,
or certified by ASD (AeroSpace, Security and Defence Industries Association of Europe).
ASD-STE100 is a specification of ASD.

Standards referenced by identifier only: RFC 2119, RFC 8174, CVE, CWE, CVSS,
MITRE ATT&CK, MITRE ATLAS, and ISO 8601. CSE is not affiliated with their maintainers.
